Query	Check
SELECT	results.length
INSERT	result.insertId
UPDATE	result.affectedRows
DELETE	result.affectedRows

--------------------------------------------------------------------

| Code  | Meaning           | Example                    |
| ----- | ----------------- | -------------------------- |
| `200` | Success           | Products fetched           |
| `201` | Created           | New order created          |
| `400` | Bad request       | Invalid/missing data       |
| `401` | Not authenticated | Token missing/invalid      |
| `403` | Not permitted     | User trying admin action   |
| `404` | Not found         | Product doesn't exist      |
| `409` | Conflict          | Email already exists       |
| `500` | Server error      | Unexpected DB/server error |

2xx → Sab theek ✅

4xx → Client/request side problem ⚠️

5xx → Server side problem ❌

-------------------------------------------------------------------

CORS
→ Kaunse browser origins API access kar sakte hain

Rate Limiting
→ Kitni requests allow karni hain

Helmet
→ HTTP security headers configure karna

-------------------------------------------------------------------

null → falsy
value → truthy